  "body": "**Blocked by:** #177\n\n## Context\n\nThis issue builds on #177 and completes the `operations` batch.\n\n## Task\n\nMonthly restore newest snapshot into disposable PostgreSQL/MinIO. Assert pg_restore success, items count >0, max(items.updated_at) freshness, doc_snapshots count >0 plus nonempty bytea, and 20 random blob objects match. On failure write backup_restore_failed through canonical notification writer and send external /fail; send HEALTHCHECKS_RESTORE_PING_URL success only after all assertions. Always destroy disposable state.\n\n## Scope\n\n### In scope\n\n- Task deliverables, migrations, integration, tests, and necessary documentation.\n\n### Out of scope\n\n- Never modify production data.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- Valid fixture passes and pings once.\n- Each injected failure emits one notification, /fail, and nonzero status.\n- No success ping on failure.\n- Disposable state is always removed.\n",
